          "content_sha": "36d7320b200b094e07197e2b24635efb73af5f9f6b7427aa41311610eafa0bd7",
          "score": 5.360454,
          "content": "[specs/SPEC-003-error-contract.md L12-16] 2. 错误表达\n## 2. 错误表达\n\n服务层用 `ValueError` 表达参数错误；HTTP 层把 `ValueError` 映射为\nHTTP 400 且响应体形如 `{\"error\": \"<message>\"}`。"
        },
        {
          "doc_id": "spec:specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md#2",
          "kind": "spec",
          "path": "specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md",
          "symbol": "2. 未评分条目的处理",
          "heading": "2. 未评分条目的处理",
          "line_from": 18,
          "line_to": 22,
          "content_sha": "718488a92a42156d9227f6233a277c3ff8a7be014996ef215af1f28aac907cdb",
          "score": 5.228587,
          "content": "[specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md L18-22] 2. 未评分条目的处理\n## 2. 未评分条目的处理\n\n`rating` 为 `None` 表示未评分。`min_rating` 一旦给出，未评分条目必须被排除，\n不得把 `None` 当作 0 或当作满分参与比较。"
        },
        {
          "doc_id": "spec:specs/SPEC-002-ordering-and-pagination.md#3",
          "kind": "spec",
          "path": "specs/SPEC-002-ordering-and-pagination.md",
          "symbol": "3. 分页参数",
          "heading": "3. 分页参数",
          "line_from": 20,
          "line_to": 25,
          "content_sha": "66f78c58754ea3acc9abf7a9df85be8ebeaf714c7c7b9c8f0cef7f44dd6ffe33",
          "score": 4.787816,
          "content": "[specs/SPEC-002-ordering-and-pagination.md L20-25] 3. 分页参数\n## 3. 分页参数\n\n- `page` 为 1 起始的正整数；`page < 1` 或非整数时抛出 `ValueError`。\n- `page_size` 必须在 1..100 之间，越界或非整数时抛出 `ValueError`。\n- 未知的 `sort` 取值抛出 `ValueError`。"
        },
        {
          "doc_id": "spec:specs/SPEC-004-export-csv.md#1",
          "kind": "spec",
          "path": "specs/SPEC-004-export-csv.md",
          "symbol": "1. 能力声明",
          "heading": "1. 能力声明",
          "line_from": 7,
          "line_to": 11,
          "content_sha": "31b5a65df9c6ecbbe4dca0c98fd67ef16392ca9dc0b60bd25fb6eca7360e4870",
          "score": 4.60701,
          "content": "[specs/SPEC-004-export-csv.md L7-11] 1. 能力声明\n## 1. 能力声明\n\n导出（CSV）必须复用 `list_items` 的筛选语义：`status` 与 `min_rating` 的作用范围、\n未评分条目在给出 `min_rating` 时被排除、分页与排序语义均与列表查询一致。"
        },
        {
          "doc_id": "spec:specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md#4",
          "kind": "spec",
          "path": "specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md",
          "symbol": "4. 与分页、排序的关系",
          "heading": "4. 与分页、排序的关系",
          "line_from": 29,
          "line_to": 34,
          "content_sha": "0ed085bfe789e288cda7cc6d0a353989b70965e7433cc6511dd85f96d8894a8a",
          "score": 4.424747,
          "content": "[specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md L29-34] 4. 与分页、排序的关系\n## 4. 与分页、排序的关系\n\n筛选先于排序与分页：`total` 与 `total_pages` 必须描述**筛选之后**的全集。\n筛选不得改变 SPEC-002 规定的排序规则、稳定次序与分页边界语义。\n筛选不得修改服务实例的内部状态；连续调用必须彼此独立。"
        },
        {
          "doc_id": "spec:specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md#3",
          "kind": "spec",
          "path": "specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md",
          "symbol": "3. 参数校验",
          "heading": "3. 参数校验",
          "line_from": 23,
          "line_to": 28,
          "content_sha": "dfce31257eaf9691268ddf65d351ac9a4986b7b0bc47f3b3a7f7706c280f24a3",
          "score": 3.863131,
          "content": "[specs/SPEC-001-list-filter.md L23-28] 3. 参数校验\n## 3. 参数校验\n\n- `min_rating` 必须是 1..5 的整数；越界或非整数时抛出 `ValueError`。\n- `status` 必须能解析为 `Status`；非法取值抛出 `ValueError`。\n- 校验失败必须在返回任何结果之前发生，不得返回部分结果。"
        }
      ]
    },
